			  "Agents": {
			    "Internal": {
			      "Version": "1.1.0"
			    }
			  },
			  "CustomInstructions": "For cost related questions, use the TotalCostByCondition measure.  \nWhen returning the month, use the Month Short field in the Date table.\nFor user-friendly condition names, use the condition_text_source_value field in the condition_occurence table. \nFor Age groups, use the AgeGroup field in the person table.\n\nKey tables in this model:\n\ncost: Central fact table with charges, payments, and cost breakdowns (total_charge, total_paid, total_cost, paid_by_payer, paid_by_patient, paid_patient_copay, paid_patient_deductible, paid_patient_coinsurance, amount_allowed, paid_by_primary, paid_dispensing_fee, paid_ingredient_cost). Linked to billable_period_start_date and billable_period_end_date.\n\nperson: Patient demographics including gender_source_value, race_source_value, ethnicity_source_value, year_of_birth, AgeGroup. Central dimension linked to most fact tables via person_id.\n\nlocation: Geographic data (city, state, zip, country, latitude, longitude).\n\npatient_location_zip: Patient location lookup by zip code.\n\ncondition_occurrence: Diagnoses and conditions with condition_source_value, condition_text_source_value, TypeOfDiabetes, DiabeticStatus. Linked to person and visit_occurrence.\n\nDate: Calendar dimension with Year, Quarter, Month Name, Day Name, Fiscal Year, Fiscal Quarter, Is Weekend, etc."
			}
		contentType: json

